    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont know if i even want to feel grounded. what's the point in being grounded to a life that doesn't even feel like mine anymore? it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. it's just this heavy, hollow feeling every single day. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person looking back. it's like the \"me\" that actually lived is just... gone.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
